---

This backend API is publicly open and free to access.
Anyone is welcome to consume, integrate, fork, or build upon this project
for personal, educational, or commercial purposes — no permission required.

Public API Base URL: https://myke-towers-api.onrender.com

Endpoints available to everyone:
  GET /           - API welcome and endpoint index
  GET /historia   - Myke Towers biography and personal data
  GET /stats      - Career statistics and highlights
  GET /canal      - Official YouTube channel data
  GET /videos     - Top 30 YouTube videos with metadata
  GET /social     - Social wall posts and media
  GET /albums     - Full discography (albums, EPs, mixtapes)
  GET /albums/:id/songs - Track listing for a specific album
  GET /dynamic-albums   - Real-time iTunes discography sync
